{"reference":"Jeremiah 13","book":"Jeremiah","chapter":13,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"The Book Around This Chapter","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"The received book of Jeremiah brings together poems, prose sermons, narratives, letters, headings, repeated accounts, restoration collections, oracles about nations, and an appendix. Jeremiah 13 belongs within the practical grouping of chapters 2–25. That outline describes the book’s arrangement; it does not settle how the book came to be composed.","provenance_refs":["reader_path_jeremiah_013_a0043569400204308934d1b4"],"confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}